{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n 最近睡魔に本当に勝てなくて、\n 気づいたらて寝るし、すぐ夢みるんです。\n 自分でも知らないうちに眠ってるからすごいよー。\n \n よく寝る子に育ってしまいました。\n \n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n \n 17日と21日に6thシングルの\n 握手会がありました！\n 来てくださった方、ありがとうございました🎈\n \n 初めましての方がとっても多かった気がする！\n 4日ぶりって会えた方もたくさんいた！\n 嬉しいことです〜\n \n 4部制になって初めての握手会だったけれど、\n 朝から夜までお話しできて、\n とっても楽しかったですね👼\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1RRYS5BWSWR34VYKM82KS3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n みてーりささん😚\n りささんともーっとお話ししたい〜\n \n \n \n \n \n 17日\n \n \n 1部は初めてのパジャマ🐡\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1RRZRF2WDM6AD5TR4YSPMG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n ほとんどの方がパジャマって\n 気づいてなかったです、、（笑）\n パジャマっぽくなかったかなー？\n \n 朝起きて少し寒いからカーディガンを羽織って\n コーヒーを飲む大人の女性を意識しましたはい。\n \n パジャマはGU！\n \n \n \n \n 🐡2部\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1RS0V5ZAWGZYN0GX68AKVN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n ワンピース〜\n SHOWROOMでも着たやつです！\n 気づいてくれたの嬉しかったです😚\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1RS1YMCFD7V0NYVAE2FRHG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n ワンピース:select MOCA\n \n \n \n 🐡4部5部\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1RS3005K77W1963S2Y3G04","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1RS412Y8BD95K15SHHR4AE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 襟が大きい白シャツ！\n 好評でしたやったー❣️\n \n シャツ:Dholic\n 靴:Dr.Martens\n \n \n \n \n \n この日はお外に出れたから\n めいめいとちょっと寒いけど遊んだら\n 楽しかったよー\n \n ちっちゃい穴のぞいたら\n めいめいおったー！かわいすぎー！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1RS51WWNAAZTKWEWXDPPW2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1RS6D32ST4G6SHBBWRR9WF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1RS7C5H9NBGX5R97Y6GS7P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1RS8DS6E8YSEB7VF05F1G9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1RS9EY0YCHXS2RMPSGZ0BW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1RSADDN1469KF69VEWJTVH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1RSBE5D50PR7N7ZZZBZPP9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n お花ありがとうございました🌸\n \n \n \n \n 21日のことはつぎのブログに書きます。\n \n \n \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}